dragonmounts2:guide_book.name.page_5_2=Recipes > Armour
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_1=You can find many species of §5dragons§r in your world, each with their own colours, powers, and temperaments.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Start by observing them carefully and building trust with food, patience, and gentle handling.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_5=Every dragon has unique strengths, food preferences, and behaviour.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Learn the needs of your mount and you will become a better keeper.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_3_2=Trust is built slowly, not forced.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Let your dragon approach you first and reward calm behaviour.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_3_3=Feeding can guide habits and reward good behaviour.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Offer the right food and your dragon will learn to associate you with safety.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_5_1=Recipes offer the tools, gear, and crafting options you need for progression.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Use them to build armour, weapons, flutes, and other useful items.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_5_2=Armour for both dragons and players helps keep your journey safer.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Craft protective gear for your mount and for yourself, then prepare for the battles ahead.
